  "question": {
    "text": "If the roots of the quadratic equation $x^2+p x+q=0$ are $\\tan 30^{\\circ}$ and $\\tan 15^{\\circ}$, respectively then the value of $2+q-p$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
